A||N||5||3fifty||Hollow area in the firewall (speakers)?||||5||
Z||000000||3fifty||07-28-2001||05:44 PM||||I just bought two 800 series kickers to put behind my seats. They fit fine, but I rather<BR>have them off of the floor and also attached to the vehicle to help prevent theft. I would like to take the speakers out and attach the boxes to the firewall with drywall screws. How far down from the top lip<BR>of the firewall does the hollow area start. I don't want to screw into anything electrical ect.<P>Thanks,<P>3fifty one day!!!!!!||||reg||5
Z||000001||cadaver||07-29-2001||12:42 AM||||The electrica; doesnt run through the hollow space. It runs straight through from the cab to the back. Just look on the engine side to see where things are .||||reg||1
Z||000002||MooCow||07-29-2001||12:48 AM||||I was going to put subs in the firewall similar to what Fierosound did.  I measured 11" to 12" from the bottom up and drilled a small hole.  The only thing that runs through them is the gas tube, and it is only on the drivers side.  So really the only thing you have to look out for is the gas lines.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||1
Z||000003||87GTBro||07-29-2001||12:49 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firewallsub.jpg"> <P>This is what I did in my GT.  It was fairly easy to do.  If you go to fierosound's website, he has more pictures and step-by-step procedures.  Near the bottom of the fierwall there is a section about 8"x8" that is just a thin sheet metal and has a thicker firewall further back.  It gives you an extra 2.5" or so for the speaker magnet.  You can see that I had to put this speaker at an angle to keep the connection leads from shorting out on the firewall.<P>It's a little work, but it is well worth it when you hear it.<P>------------------<BR>AOL IM: GTFiero86Dan<BR>'86 GT 4 speed<BR>'87 GT Auto<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GTBrosig1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||fierosound||07-29-2001||01:35 PM||||Check this forum in the archives...<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000001/HTML/20010706-2-003613.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000001/HTML/20010706-2-003613.html</A> <P>Also - <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierosound</A> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||MooCow||07-29-2001||07:53 PM||||This is what 3fifty is working with.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3fiftysubs.jpg"> <P>Thanks Ken||||reg||1
